From 03f9be495f14cc6d07d3649f07f399b053c96999 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Codex (ELZYDLAB)" <codex@elzydlab.local>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:50:55 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] vulkan: fuse the Gated DeltaNet state snapshot copy into
 the GDN shader

The recurrent-rollback path copies the K per-token GDN states into the cache after every gated_delta_net node. This writes them from the shader directly when the copy is the only reader (bounded pattern match in ggml_vk_build_graph), with test-backend-ops coverage. Speed-neutral on an Arc Pro B60 with Qwen3.8-27B + DFlash2, kept for the reduced copy traffic.

